        "title": "",
        "subtitle": "",
        "eyebrow": "About the pantry",
        "body": "<h2>Serving our neighborhood</h2>\n<p>Timothy's food pantry serves members and neighbors in Lindenwood Park and the surrounding community. We believe that caring for the hungry is not a program — it is a natural expression of what it means to be the church in a neighborhood.</p>\n<p>No residency requirement. No appointment needed. All are welcome.</p>",
