        "type": "text",
        "title": "",
        "subtitle": "",
        "eyebrow": "Receive food",
        "body": "<h2>How to get help</h2>\n<p>The pantry is open to anyone in need — no residency requirement, no appointment, no paperwork. Just come during pantry hours. Bring a bag or box if you have one.</p>\n<p>Open the <strong>1st &amp; 3rd Saturday</strong> of every month, <strong>9:00–10:00 am</strong>.</p>\n<p>There are two ways to support the pantry: donate non-perishable food items, or volunteer to help on pantry day with setup, sorting, and distribution.</p>",
