        "body": "<h2>A neighborhood tradition</h2>\n<p>The Timothy Christmas Market is an annual outdoor market bringing the Lindenwood Park community together each December. Local artisans and vendors set up in the church grounds — offering handmade goods, food, and festive fun for families and neighbors of all kinds.</p>\n<p>The market is free and open to the public. It's one of our favorite ways to be a blessing to the neighborhood God has planted us in.</p>",
        "url": "",
